s in both the intensive and continuation phases. Oral bacteriostatic second-line TB med.','en',1,'2011-01-17 16:30:18',NULL,NULL,'16545FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),(16546,73498,'Reinforcement TB med with unclear efficacy. Clarithromycin is a macrolide antibiotic used to treat pharyngitis, tonsillitis, acute maxillary sinusitis, acute bacterial exacerbation of chronic bronchitis, pneumonia (especially atypical pneumonias associated with Chlamydia pneumoniae or TWAR), skin and skin structure infections, and, in HIV and AIDS patients to prevent, and to treat, disseminated Mycobacterium avium complex (MAC). In addition, it is sometimes used to treat Legionellosis. ','en',1,'2011-01-17 16:31:20',NULL,NULL,'16546FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),(16547,160020,'A basic polypeptide antibiotic (trade name Viocin) administered intramuscularly (along with other drugs) in the treatment of tuberculosis ','en',1,'2011-01-17 16:33:05',NULL,NULL,'16547FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),(16548,160021,'Convenience set of TB drugs','en',1,'2011-01-17 16:39:36',NULL,NULL,'16548FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),(16554,160029,'Structured entries from free text clinician notes','en',1,'2011-01-17 20:40:33',NULL,NULL,'16554FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),(16565,160047,'Used to describe a concentration in a DST test. Maps to datatype double. ','en',1,'2011-01-18 01:36:53',NULL,NULL,'16565FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),(16607,160081,'How many times did she undergo cesarean section for delivering baby?','en',1,'2011-02-24 13:45:35',1,'2013-01-10 17:28:17','16607FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),(16650,160143,'Category used for specifying acute viral hepatitis other than a and c.','en',1,'2011-06-08 15:32:35',1,NULL,'16650FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),(16651,160146,'A fatal viral disease caused by rabies virus.','en',1,'2011-06-08 15:43:01',1,'2016-05-27 02:51:49','16651FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),(16653,160201,'Category of diagnoses','en',1,'2011-06-09 13:26:24',1,'2013-02-